== Trivia ==
* "Cat got your tongue" is an idiom for when people are speechless.
* Aside from the obvious change in language, the Korean unlock for the challenge is notably different. Instead of a cat vomiting a hairball, it seems to depict a cat eating the hairball back.[[File:KoreanCatGotYourTongue.png|frame]]

